  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOS 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okobugwa na ogosarigwa kwa Ai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene agateebia Yoshua, “Toondoka, gose toiroka, imoka oire abarwani b’esegi amo naye, ogende orwanie omochie o Ai, Rora, nabeekire omorwoti o Ai, na abanto baye, amo nomochie na ense yaye, ase amaboko ao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okore omorwoti o Ai na omochie oye buna gwakorete Yeriko na omorwoti oye. Korende ase engaki eye monyare koira ebinto ne chitugo morasakore, bibe ebiaino. Obeke abanto baboere omochie, na koyoumokera korwa magega.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yoshua amo nabarwani bonsi, bakebeeka ang’e kogenda korwania Ai. Agachora abanto chilifu emerongo etato abaare chituoni chie chinguru, akabatoma aroro botuko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabachika akabateebia, “Genda mwebise, moboere omochie korwa magega, timobeera aare, korende mwebeeke ang’e koyoumokera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche amo nabarwani bonsi tore komo natoumokere omochie. Ekero abanto ba Ai barasoke gotorwania, buna bakorete engaki eria ye ritang’ani, intwe ntotame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio batobwatie, naintwe tobang’use gochia aare korwa ase omochie. Barabwo barengererie iga: Bono batamire korwa ase tore, buna bakorete engaki eria ye ritang’ani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono ekero togotama, inwe morue ase moboete, moumokere omochie, ekiagera Omonene, Nyasae oino, oyobeekire ase amaboko aino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero mwabwatire omochie goika moyosambe, buna Omonene achiikire, Morigererie mono, mokore buna nabachiikire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo Yoshua akabatoma, na barabwo bakagenda, bakaboa egati ya Beteli na Ai, bosongo ya Ai. Korende Yoshua agatigara, akabeera amo nabaanto obotuko obwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua akaimoka, mambia chuni, akaroberia abanto baye, ere amo nabagaaka b’Abaisraeli bagatang’ana abanto gochia Ai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarwani bonsi, abarenge amo nere, bagatiira, bagaika ang’e nomochie, bagatoora sugusu ya Ai; rikura ndiarenge egati yabo na Ai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua agachora abarwani chilifu isano, akababisa bosongo y’omochie, ase egati ya Beteli na Ai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo abarwani baroberetigwe: Omoganda omonene bw’abarwani okabeekwa sugusu y’omochie, na abarwani bande bakabeekwa koboa bosongo y’omochie. Yoshua akagenda, akabeera gati‐gati ye rikura obotuko boria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omorwoti o Ai aroche amang’ana buna are, akaayerera amo nabaanto baye baare omochie ime, bakebeeka ang’e. Bakayerera, bakaboka mambia chuni bagasoka korwania Abaisraeli agwo aase aragetwe, kororia Ekerubo Ekiomo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Korende omorwoti tamanyete ng’a abarwani mbaboete magega y’omochie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua amo n’Abaisraeli bonsi bagekora buna babuirwe, bagatama gochia erooro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bonsi b’omochie bakarangerigwa kobabwatia, na kobabwatirie Yoshua, bakang’uswa gochia aare korwa ase omochie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera omonto agatiga omochie ase okobwatia Abaisraeli. Onde tatigarete ime ya Ai, gose Beteli; omochie ogatigwa bosa otari na getango.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene agateebia Yoshua, “Raga ne ritimo riao rire koboko kwao gochia Ai, ekiagera ninkoe omochie oyo ase amaboko ao.” Yoshua akaraga omochie ne ritimo abwate koboko kwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwango ekero Yoshua aramborete okoboko kwaye, abarwani baria bakaimoka korwa ase baboete bakaminyoka gochia ase omochie, bakayobwata. Erio bwango bakayosamba nomorero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto ba Ai bagachia korigereria magega, bakarora erioki korwa ase omochie rikoimoka igoro. Bagasinywa gotama gochia aaria na aaria, ekiagera Abaisraeli abwo konya batamire gochia erooro bakairana kobaumokera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Yoshua na Abaisraeli bonsi baroche ng’a abwo baboete babwatire omochie na koyosamba, bakairana, bagachaaka goita abanto ba Ai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli abarenge ase omochie ime bagatirimboka gochiao. Ase igo abanto ba Ai bagaetananwa kegima n’Abaisraeli, na bonsi bagaitwa. Onde tatigarete otooregete,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "otatiga omorwoti o Ai. Ere akabwatwa, akarentwa ore moyo ase Yoshua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Abaisraeli bakoorire goita abanto bonsi ba Ai abarenge agwo aase aarabu, na ase erooro, ase baabaseretie gochia, bakairana Ai, bagaita nemioro bonsi abarenge aroro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonsi abaitetwe ase rituko erio abasacha na bakungu nigo barenge abanto chilifu ikomi na ibere. Abwo nabwo barenge abanto bonsi ba Ai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua taringete okoboko kwaye, okwo kwabwatete ritimo goika ekero abanto bonsi ba Ai baitetwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli bakaira chitugo na ebinto binde basakorete bikaba ebiabo, buna Omonene atebeetie Yoshua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua agasamba omochie o Ai, akayotiga ore ritombe, nabo ore goika reero iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agatonga omorwoti o Ai ase omote igoro, akamotigao goika mogoroba. Ekero erioba rikogwa Yoshua agachiika ng’a egetondo gesungorwe, getugutwe ase egeita ki’omochie; na abanto bagakora bo. Erio bakagetuba amagena, akaba etui eyereo goika reero iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amachiiko a Nyasae agosomwa ase egetunwa ki’Ebali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua akaagachera Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, egesasiimero ase egetunwa ki’Ebali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agakeagacha buna Musa, omosomba bw’Omonene, achigete Abaisraeli, buna ariikire ase Egetabu ki’Amachiko a Musa: “Egesasiimero keagacheire amagena atabaachetwe negekorero gi’ekioma.” Agwo bakaruera Omonene ekeng’wanso ki’ogosambwa, na eki’omorembe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.31",
